DASHTE GURBAT MAY NA YUNN CHHOD KE JAO ABBAS <br>
ROOKAY KEHTEY THHAY YE SARWAR NA RULAO ABBAS<br>
<br>
1. KISTARHA DOON TUJHE MARNE KI IJAZAT BHAI <br>
 TERE HI DAM SE HAI SHABBIR KO QUWWAT BHAI <br>
 PHIR KAHAN PAAOUNGA MAI TERI MOHABBAT BHAI <br>
 APNE BHAI KO ZARA TUM HI BATAO ABBAS<br>
<br>
2. KYUN KAMAR BAANDHE HO AADA PA CHADHAYII KE LIYE <br>
 HAAN MAGAR TUMKO NA JAANA HAI LADAYII KE LIYE <br>
 BAAZU KATWANA HAI UMMAT KI BHALAYII KE LIYE<br>
 MERI BATAON SE MAGAR DIL NA DUKHAO ABBAS<br>
<br>
3. YEH NA SOONCHA KE TERE BAAD MERA KYA HOGA <br>
 AUR KUCH DAIR MAY AKBAR BHI RAWANA HOGA <br>
 KOUN SHABBIR KI PEERI KA SAHARA HOGA<br>
 KAISE DU&rsquo;N TUMKO RIZA ITNA BATAO ABBAS<br>
<br>
4. MERE BHAI MERE LASHKAR KE ALAMDAR HO TUM <br>
 HAQ ME ZAINAB KE LIYE HYDER E KARRAR HO TUM <br>
 AUR BEKAS KE GHARIBON KE MADADGAAR HO TUM <br>
 KYA MAI ZAINAB KO BATAON YE BATAO ABBAS<br>
<br>
5. TERE MARNE SE KUNBA PARESHA&rsquo;N HOGA <br>
 BEKASI HOYEGI OR DASHTE GHARIBAA&rsquo;N HOGA<br>
 KOUN PHIR CHADAR E ZAINAB KA NIGEHBAA&rsquo;N HOGA <br>
 APNI BEHNOU&rsquo;N PE ZARA RAHEM TOU KHAO ABBAS<br>
<br>
6. BHAI KO ROOTAY HUWAY CHHOD KE KYA JAAOGEY <br>
 WASWASEY AATAY HAIN TUM LOUT KE NA AAOGEY <br>
 MERI MINNAT PA BHI KYA RAHEM NAHI KHAOGEY <br>
 KAISE MAIN TUMKO MANAO&rsquo;N YE BATAO ABBAS<br>
<br>
7. MOOSVI KAHTE THAY GHAZI SE SHAIHEY KOUN O MAKAAN <br>
 SAAT BATTEES BARAS HII KA THA AYE RAHATE JAAN T<br>
 UM BICHAD JAO TOU PHIR ZEEST KA IMKAAN KAHAN<br>
 MERI GURBAT PA TARAS KHAO NA JAO ABBAS<br>
